OL,3,GNEWSAProtest over social housing
OL,4,Aworkers' allowance cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA protest featuring a masked robber and
OL,7,Fa giant inflatable rat has been held
OL,8,Foutside a call centre where a union
OL,9,Fclaims some workers are set to lose a
OL,10,F#1,700 a year allowance.
OL,12,FThe Unite union said the cutting of the
OL,13,Fbenefit introduced in 2024 amounted to
OL,14,Fa 6% pay cut for nearly 150 staff at
OL,15,Fthe Sanctuary Housing office in Hull.
OL,17,FUnite regional officer Andy Masterman
OL,18,Fsaid the reduction by the social
OL,19,Fhousing company would "risk pushing
OL,20,Fpeople into in-work poverty".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
